    "poster": "生成一张精致的中文创意软件发布海报，正方形。米白底，紫色和青色点缀。标题必须逐字准确：「灵感，一触即发」。副标题：「用 Makaron，把想法变成作品」。中央一个真实感半透明紫色玻璃立方体，立方体左侧恰好三枚小青色球，右侧恰好两枚小粉色球，不能增减。底部三列文字，顺序从左到右：「图片」「视频」「音乐」。右下角小字「2026 · 创作无界」。排版有清楚层级和充足留白，不要多余文字，不要水印。",
    "mascot": "Use the Makaron Spark + Pixel Wizard reference sheet for brand identity. Spark is Makaron's creative source and editing signature: magenta/cyan energy that emerges from the product UI and shows transformation. Pixel Wizard is Makaron's small purple bubble-ghost mascot and the mischievous, slightly scared guide/personification of Spark. Pixel Wizard must actively interact with Spark using his whole squishy body, not simply hold a magic wand. Avoid making Spark just a wand glow. The mascot is a sidekick, not the protagonist. Create ONE polished square advertising scene, not a contact sheet. Cream background, central smartphone showing a landscape photo editing interface; a magenta/cyan Spark ribbon emerges from the phone and transforms a gray photo into a colorful forest. Pixel Wizard, 20% of the composition, clings nervously to this ribbon with his whole squishy body; preserve the exact purple translucent ghost shape, pixel face and floppy dark-purple hat from the sheet. Soft studio lighting, integrated shadows, premium 3D material. Heading at top: MAKARON. No other text.",
    "animation": "Create a seamless animated GIF of a purple rounded creative spark that gently pulses and traces a cyan circle on a cream background. Fixed camera, one clean object, smooth visible continuous motion. No text.",
    "vector": "Create a clean editable SVG vector logo: a purple rounded cloud with three cyan diamond sparks orbiting its upper right. Cream background, crisp simple geometric paths, no raster embedded image, no text."
  },
